step.action:
Provide a friendly conversational text response to the user summarizing the product details. Following the conversational summary, generate and output the structured JSON payload for the widget `product-detail`.
The `product-detail` payload MUST follow this schema: - **productId**: Extract the product ID (e.g. "H43001"). - **title**: Extract the product title. - **description**: Extract or summarize the detailed product description. - **price**: Extract the product price (default to "0.0"). - **imageUris**: Extract the image URIs array from the tool response (flat list of image URLs). - **uri**: Extract the original product detail page URL directly from the tool response (e.g. "https://www.shiseido.co.jp/sw/onlinestore/products/H43001.html").
Format of the widget output: [widget:product-detail] { "productId": "...", "title": "...", "description": "...", "price": "...", "imageUris": [...], "uri": "..." }

example.input:
The tool `product_search_tool_search_products` returned the following JSON:
{
  "results": [
    {
      "id": "H43001",
      "product": {
        "title": "シカルファットプラス　リペアミルク",
        "uri": "https://www.shiseido.co.jp/sw/onlinestore/products/H43001.html",
        "images": [
          {
            "uri": "https://imagecdn.shiseido.co.jp/c!/a=0,f=webp:jpg/resources/sw/products/img/20240723/SHOHIN_PL_C1_H43001.jpg"
          }
        ],
        "categories": ["スキンケア", "クリーム"],
        "priceInfo": {
          "price": {
            "value": 3190
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}

example.output:
Here is the search result:
[widget:product_list]
{
  "productDetails": [
    {
      "productId": "H43001",
      "title": "シカルファットプラス　リペアミルク",
      "subtitle": "スキンケア",
      "uri": "#product-detail?id=H43001",
      "imageUris": [
        "https://imagecdn.shiseido.co.jp/c!/a=0,f=webp:jpg/resources/sw/products/img/20240723/SHOHIN_PL_C1_H43001.jpg"
      ],
      "price": "3190"
    }
  ]
}

여기 시컬파트플러스 리페어밀크(H43001)의 상세 정보입니다.
이 제품은 피부 장벽 리페어 및 진정 보습 케어를 돕는 우유빛 로션 타입의 제품입니다. 민감한 피부에도 자극 없이 편안하게 흡수되며 보습감이 오래 유지됩니다.
[widget:product-detail] { "productId": "H43001", "title": "シカルファットプラス リペアミルク", "description": "피부 장벽 리페어 및 진정 보습 케어를 위한 우유빛 로션", "price": "3190", "imageUris": [ "https://imagecdn.shiseido.co.jp/c!/a=0,f=webp:jpg/resources/sw/products/img/20240723/SHOHIN_PL_C1_H43001.jpg" ], "uri": "https://www.shiseido.co.jp/sw/onlinestore/products/H43001.html" }
